ry navigation\"><button data-testid=\"nav-products\">PRODUCTS <span>⌄</span></button><button data-testid=\"nav-solutions\">SOLUTIONS <span>⌄</span></button><a data-testid=\"nav-lumimorph\" href=\"/lumimorph\">LUMIMORPH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-naturatex\" href=\"/naturatex\">NATURATEX</a><a data-testid=\"nav-signatouch\" href=\"/signatouch\">SIGNATOUCH</a><a data-testid=\"nav-glassmorph\" href=\"/glassmorph\">GLASSMORPH</a><button data-testid=\"nav-more-btn\">☰ <span>⌄</span></button></nav><button class=\"mobile-menu-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\" data-testid=\"mobile-menu-toggle\">☰</button></div></header><main data-testid=\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"Colorlight Z6 Media Server\", \"description\": \"The Colorlight Z6 Media Server is an all-in-one solution offering 4K@60Hz output, 128GB SSD storage, and versatile network options including WiFi, 4G, and LAN. Cloud-managed and designed for seamless content scheduling and LED display control, it is ideal for digital signage, advertising, corporate displays, and event management where reliable high-resolution playback and remote control are essential.\", \"sku\": \"BL-ACC-CLZ6\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/colorlight-z6-media-server\", \"category\": \"accessories\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_colorlight-z6-media-server.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 50, \"highPrice\": 2000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/colorlight-z6-media-server\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"N/A\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"N/A\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What video output resolution does the Colorlight Z6 Media Server support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Colorlight Z6 Media Server supports a 4K output resolution at 60Hz, ensuring crisp and smooth high-definition video playback for LED displays.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How can I connect the media server to my network?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This device offers multiple network connectivity options including WiFi, 4G, and LAN, providing flexible and reliable connection methods tailored to different installation environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there any internal storage available on the Colorlight Z6?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it comes equipped with a 128GB SSD, which provides ample storage for high-quality media files and smooth content scheduling.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the cloud management feature benefit users?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Cloud management allows remote control and monitoring of content schedules and LED display operations, enabling efficient and centralized management across multiple display locations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty options are available with this media server?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a standard manufacturer warranty for the Colorlight Z6 Media Server, typically covering hardware defects and performance issues. Please contact us for detailed warranty terms.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the Colorlight Z6 compare to other media servers?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Z6 combines high-resolution 4K output with versatile network options and integrated cloud management, distinguishing it from alternatives that may lack remote management or multi-network connectivity.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this device be used for digital advertising content scheduling?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. It is designed for content scheduling, playback, and LED display management, making it ideal for digital signage and advertising applications.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is installation of the Colorlight Z6 Media Server complex?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is straightforward with plug-and-play capabilities and flexible connectivity options. Brightluxx also provides professional support to ensure seamless integration.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Colorlight Z6 Media Server\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/colorlight-z6-media-server\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>Colorlight Z6 Media Server</h1><p>Enhance LED display content with Colorlight Z6 Media Server. Available in Dubai and UAE. Contact Brightluxx for advanced LED tech!</p><p><strong>All-in-one media playback and LED control. Cloud-managed.</strong></p><p>The Colorlight Z6 Media Server is an all-in-one solution offering 4K@60Hz output, 128GB SSD storage, and versatile network options including WiFi, 4G, and LAN. Cloud-managed and designed for seamless content scheduling and LED display control, it is ideal for digital signage, advertising, corporate displays, and event management where reliable high-resolution playback and remote control are essential.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What video output resolution does the Colorlight Z6 Media Server support?</h3><p>The Colorlight Z6 Media Server supports a 4K output resolution at 60Hz, ensuring crisp and smooth high-definition video playback for LED displays.</p><h3>How can I connect the media server to my network?</h3><p>This device offers multiple network connectivity options including WiFi, 4G, and LAN, providing flexible and reliable connection methods tailored to different installation environments.</p><h3>Is there any internal storage available on the Colorlight Z6?</h3><p>Yes, it comes equipped with a 128GB SSD, which provides ample storage for high-quality media files and smooth content scheduling.</p><h3>How does the cloud management feature benefit users?</h3><p>Cloud management allows remote control and monitoring of content schedules and LED display operations, enabling efficient and centralized management across multiple display locations.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><footer class=\"site-footer\" data-testid=\"footer\"><div class=\"site-footer__inner\"><section class=\"site-footer__brand\"><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\" alt=\"Brightluxx\"/></a><p>Premium LED display solutions for UAE and MENA. Established since 2005.</p><div><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"Instagram\" data-testid=\"footer-social-instagram\">◎</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/brightluxx/\" aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" data-testid=\"footer-social-linkedin\">in</a></div></section><section><h2>EXPLORE</h2><a href=\"/products\">PRODUCTS</a><a href=\"/solutions\">SOLUTIONS</a><a href=\"/technology\">TECHNOLOGY</a><a href=\"/case-studies\">CASE STUDIES</a><a href=\"/blog\">BLOG</a></section><section><h