s.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"What warranty options are available with this media server?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Brightluxx offers a standard manufacturer warranty for the Colorlight Z6 Media Server, typically covering hardware defects and performance issues. Please contact us for detailed warranty terms.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"How does the Colorlight Z6 compare to other media servers?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"The Z6 combines high-resolution 4K output with versatile network options and integrated cloud management, distinguishing it from alternatives that may lack remote management or multi-network connectivity.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Can this device be used for digital advertising content scheduling?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Absolutely. It is designed for content scheduling, playback, and LED display management, making it ideal for digital signage and advertising applications.\\\"}}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Question\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Is installation of the Colorlight Z6 Media Server complex?\\\", \\\"acceptedAnswer\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Answer\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\"Installation is straightforward with plug-and-play capabilities and flexible connectivity options. Brightluxx also provides professional support to ensure seamless integration.\\\"}}]}9:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"main\\\",null,{\\\"data-testid\\\":\\\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$13\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$14\\\"}}],\\\"$L15\\\",\\\"$L16\\\",\\\"$L17\\\"],\\\"$L18\\\"]}]\\n15:[\\\"$