 \\\\\\\"sales\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"SA\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"QA\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"KW\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"BH\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"OM\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"availableLanguage\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"en\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"ar\\\\\\\"]}}\\\"}}]\\n17:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LocalBusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"priceRange\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\\\\\u00b2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"geo\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"GeoCoordinates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"latitude\\\\\\\": 24.9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n19:T652,\\u003ch1\\u003eColorlight Z6 Media Server\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eEnhance LED display content with Colorlight Z6 Media Server. Available in Dubai and UAE. Contact Brightluxx for advanced LED tech!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAll-in-one media playback and LED control. Cloud-managed.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe Colorlight Z6 Media Server is an all-in-one solution offering 4K@60Hz output, 128GB SSD storage, and versatile network options including WiFi, 4G, and LAN. Cloud-managed and designed for seamless content scheduling and LED display control, it is ideal for digital signage, advertising, corporate displays, and event management where reliable high-resolution playback and remote control are essential.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat video output resolution does the Colorlight Z6 Media Server support?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe Colorlight Z6 Media Server supports a 4K output resolution at 60Hz, ensuring crisp and smooth high-definition video playback for LED displays.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow can I connect the media server to my network?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThis device offers multiple network connectivity options including WiFi, 4G, and LAN, providing flexible and reliable connection methods tailored to different installation environments.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eIs there any internal storage available on the Colorlight Z6?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes, it comes equipped with a 128GB SSD, which provides ample storage for high-quality media files and smooth content scheduling.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow does the cloud management feature benefit users?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eCloud management allows remote control and monitoring of content schedules and LED display operations, enabling efficient and centralized management across multiple display locations.\\u003c/p\\u003e18:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"danger