edia Server\", \"description\": \"The Colorlight Z6 Media Server is an all-in-one solution offering 4K@60Hz output, 128GB SSD storage, and versatile network options including WiFi, 4G, and LAN. Cloud-managed and designed for seamless content scheduling and LED display control, it is ideal for digital signage, advertising, corporate displays, and event management where reliable high-resolution playback and remote control are essential.\", \"sku\": \"BL-ACC-CLZ6\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/colorlight-z6-media-server\", \"category\": \"accessories\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_colorlight-z6-media-server.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 50, \"highPrice\": 2000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/colorlight-z6-media-server\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"N/A\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"N/A\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}14:Ta2d,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What video output resolution does the Colorlight Z6 Media Server support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Colorlight Z6 Media Server supports a 4K output resolution at 60Hz, ensuring crisp and smooth high-definition video playback for LED displays.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How can I connect the media server to my network?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This device offers multiple network connectivity options including WiFi, 4G, and LAN, providing flexible and reliable connection methods tailored to different installation environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there any internal storage available on the Colorlight Z6?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it comes equipped with a 128GB SSD, which provides ample storage for high-quality media files and smooth content scheduling.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the cloud management feature benefit users?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Cloud management allows remote control and monitoring of content schedules and LED display operations, enabling efficient and centralized management across multiple display locations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty options are available with this media server?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a standard manufacturer warranty for the Colorlight Z6 Media Server, typically covering hardware defects and performance issues. Please contact us for detailed warranty terms.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the Colorlight Z6 compare to other media servers?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Z6 combines high-resolution 4K output with versatile network options and integrated cloud management, distinguishing it from alternatives that may lack remote management or multi-network connectivity.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this device be used for digital advertising content scheduling?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. It is designed for content scheduling, playback, and LED display management, making it ideal for digital signage and advertising applications.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is installation of the Colorlight Z6 Media Server complex?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is straightforward with plug-and-play capabilities and flexible connectivity options. Brightluxx also provides professional support to ensure seamless integration.\"}}]}9:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$13\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}],\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\"],\"$L18\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Colorlight Z6 Media Server\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/colorlight-z6-media-server\\\"}]}\"}}]\n16:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n17:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n19:T652,<h1>Colorlight Z6 Media Server</h1><p>Enhance LED display content with Colorlight Z6 Media Server. Available in Dubai and UAE. Contact Brightluxx for advanced LED tech!</p><p><strong>All-in-one media playback and LED control. Cloud-managed.</strong></p><p>The Colorlight Z6 Media Server is an all-in-one solution offering 4K@60Hz output, 128GB SSD storage, and versatile network options including WiFi, 4G, and LAN. Cloud-managed and designed for seamless content scheduling and LED display control, it is ideal for digital signage, advertising, corporate displays, and event management where reliable high-resolution playback and remote control are essential.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What video output resolution does the Colorlight Z6 Media Server support?</h3><p>The Colorlight Z6 Media Server supports a 4K output resolution at 60Hz, ensuring crisp and smooth high-definition video playback for LED displays.</p><h3>How can I connect the media server to my network?</h3><p>This device offers multiple network connectivity options including WiFi, 4G, and LAN, providing flexible and reliable connection methods tailored to different installation environments.</p><h3>Is there any internal storage available on the Colorlight Z6?</h3><p>Yes, it comes equipped with a 128GB SSD, which provides ample storage for high-quality media files and smooth content scheduling.</p><h3>How does the cloud management feature benefit users?</h3><p>Cloud management allows remote control and monitoring of content schedules and LED display operations, enabling efficient and centralized management across multiple display locations.</p>18:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$19\"}}]\nf:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\nc:null\n11:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Colorlight Z6 Media Server - LED Solutions Dubai & GCC | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Enhance LED display content with Colorlight Z6 Media Server. Available in Dubai and UAE. Contact Brightluxx for advanced LED tech!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/colorlight-z6-media-server\"}]]\n","segmen