g and LED display control, it is ideal for digital signage, advertising, corporate displays, and event management where reliable high-resolution playback and remote control are essential.\", \"sku\": \"BL-ACC-CLZ6\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/colorlight-z6-media-server\", \"category\": \"accessories\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_colorlight-z6-media-server.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 50, \"highPrice\": 2000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/colorlight-z6-media-server\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"N/A\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"N/A\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}14:Ta2d,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What video output resolution does the Colorlight Z6 Media Server support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Colorlight Z6 Media Server supports a 4K output resolution at 60Hz, ensuring crisp and smooth high-definition video playback for LED displays.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How can I connect the media server to my network?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This device offers multiple network connectivity options including WiFi, 4G, and LAN, providing flexible and reliable connection methods tailored to different installation environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is there any internal storage available on the Colorlight Z6?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it comes equipped with a 128GB SSD, which provides ample storage for high-quality media files and smooth content scheduling.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the cloud management feature benefit users?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Cloud management allows remote control and monitoring of content schedules and LED display operations, enabling efficient and centralized management across multiple display locations.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty options are available with this media server?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a standard manufacturer warranty for the Colorlight Z6 Media Server, typically covering hardware defects and performance issues. Please contact us for detailed warranty terms.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the Colorlight Z6 compare to other media servers?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Z6 combines high-resolution 4K output with versatile network options and integrated cloud management, distinguishing it from alternatives that may lack remote management or multi-network connectivity.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can this device be used for digital advertising content scheduling?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. It is designed for content scheduling, playback, and LED display management, making it ideal for digital signage and advertising applications.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is installation of the Colorlight Z6 Media Server complex?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Installation is strai